    "Closed rest line, left corner and lip shadow have exact original d and colors; teeth/tongue opacity zero. Face repair only closes the old neutral mouth hole.",
    "All poses have identical command and numeric topology per layer. Avoid CSS scaleY or rotating the whole mouth.",
    "Use smooth amplitude attack/release. Formant/viseme evidence can select round; amplitude alone should blend rest/small/half/open.",
    "Do not use mouth RMS to move eyebrows or recolor eyes.",
    "Use the matching R5 SVG, JSON and controller together. Half and open are expanded versions of the accepted small pose; round is unchanged from R4."
